cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the underlying SRC / DFM framework, please cite it as below."
title: "Scalar Relaxation Cosmology — DFM Finite-Gap Engine"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "warpXspeed"
    email: ""
repository-code: "https://github.com/warpXspeed/scalar-relaxation-cosmology"
url: "https://github.com/warpXspeed/scalar-relaxation-cosmology"
abstract: >-
  Algebraic core for Scalar Relaxation Cosmology (SRC) that realizes the
  Dynamic Fluid Medium as finite-gap solutions on the Sato Grassmannian.
  Provides exact (non-grid) reconstruction of potential, current, and shear
  from the Riemann theta function; pulse injection with permanent phase
  memory; path-dependent adiabatic moduli drift; and a measured adiabatic
  validity condition ε ≲ 0.05.
keywords:
  - scalar relaxation cosmology
  - Sato Grassmannian
  - finite-gap integration
  - integrable systems
  - Dynamic Fluid Medium
  - adiabatic moduli drift
license: MIT
